# PROBE complement. ¬B ⊑ C on the left, with B ⊑ C, makes C everything: A ⊑ C (excluded middle).
# construct: ObjectComplementOf
# expect: sub :A :C
# expect-not: sub :A :B

@prefix :     <http://example.org/t#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdf:  <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd:  <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

<http://example.org/t> a owl:Ontology .
:A a owl:Class . :B a owl:Class . :C a owl:Class .
:B rdfs:subClassOf :C .
[ a owl:Class ; owl:complementOf :B ] rdfs:subClassOf :C .
